title = "Station 2: Sentry & Line of Sight Arena"
summary = "Demonstrates two Access Point modes sharing the same firing sequence:
1. 'Smart Sentry (Line of Sight)' (default): Checks Distance AND RayCast2D Line Of Sight before alerting and firing.
2. 'Blind Turret (Proximity Only)': Bypasses Line Of Sight and fires whenever the player enters range, even behind cover."
